    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.poster.avif?t=1755422523\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.webm?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.mp4?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME, UNIT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filthium Zero is a single-player action roguelite featuring a mix of vertical and ground combat. Purge the Filthium-infested zones of Earth, battle hordes of mutants, unlock powerful upgrades to survive, and watch the ragdolls fly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.poster.avif?t=1755422523\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.webm?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.mp4?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: purge the corrupted zones of Earth by extracting Filthium from the water and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades secured by their predecessors. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.poster.avif?t=1755422523\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.webm?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.mp4?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERTICAL &amp; GROUND COMBAT<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your Extraction Barrel from the sky for a heavy impact, slam yourself down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades.  <br><br>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0\ud83d\udc80<strong> </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.poster.avif?t=1755422523\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.webm?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/ddd29c853281add2b60133dcb13b3f3a.mp4?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME, UNIT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filthium Zero is a single-player action roguelite featuring a mix of vertical and ground combat. Purge the Filthium-infested zones of Earth, battle hordes of mutants, unlock powerful upgrades to survive, and watch the ragdolls fly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.poster.avif?t=1755422523\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.webm?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/70af729652fb5941c1f5f0d06321afe1.mp4?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURGE, SURVIVE, ADVANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: purge the corrupted zones of Earth by extracting Filthium from the water and depositing it into  Collectors, while defeating hordes of zombies and mutants. Each deployment is a new UNIT soldier, armed with upgrades secured by their predecessors. Gather resources, improve survival odds, and push UNIT\u2019s mission forward - one soldier at a time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.poster.avif?t=1755422523\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.webm?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514090/extras/d8c7280426ddcc872f2256447fbc91d4.mp4?t=1755422523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VERTICAL &amp; GROUND COMBAT<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce off slimes to launch into the air, throw your Extraction Barrel from the sky for a heavy impact, slam yourself down with force, and send ragdolls flying in every direction. Activate and combine powerful abilities, collect resources, and customize the next UNIT with a growing arsenal of upgrades.  <br><br>DEPLOY NOW, UNIT!\u00a0\ud83d\udc80<strong> </strong></p>",
